        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. This hard and\nsharp fang boosts the power of\nDragon-type moves.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "硬くて　鋭い　キバ。\n持たせると　ドラゴンタイプの\n技の　威力が　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "坚硬锐利的牙齿。\n携带后，龙属性的\n招式威力就会提高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Colmillo de gran dureza que refuerza los movimientos\nde tipo Dragón. Debe llevarlo un Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
